SUMMARY:Boston Founder House Party
LOCATION:Cambridge\, MA\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Event Link: https://markitai.com/u/jonathan/e/lNlfA5LPaM\nMarki
 t Profile: https://markitai.com/u/jonathan\nStart: Nov 6\, 2026\, 8:00 PM\n
 End: Nov 7\, 2026\, 12:00 AM\nLocation: Cambridge\, MA\, USA\nEvent Type: M
 arkit\nMarkit Event ID: lNlfA5LPaM\n\nSF founders throw house parties on Fr
 iday nights. Boston founders network on Tuesdays at 6pm. Let's change that.
 \nAfter a few weeks out in SF\, I'm throwing the first Boston founder house
  party. When I posted about this on\nLinkedIn\nand\nInstagram\n\, it went s
 emi-viral. It got 70K+ impressions and a flood of DMs from people asking wh
 en it was happening. Everyone was begging for it\, so we decided to actuall
 y do something about it.\nSo here it is. We're keeping the first one small 
 and bringing together a hand-picked group of Boston's best founders and bui
 lders for a Friday night where you can actually let loose. If this becomes 
 a thing\, you'll want to say you were at the first one.\nBella Pivo and I a
 re hosting it at her apartment in Cambridge. The exact address goes out to 
 approved guests.\nSpace is very limited and every guest is approved by hand
 . If there's someone you think should be there\, message one of us!
URL:https://markitai.com/u/jonathan/e/lNlfA5LPaM
END:VEVENT
